# Classifier v5 evaluation

Legacy = rules + TF-IDF category + MiniLM type head. v4 = rules + finaura-v4. v5 = rules + ensemble ['finaura-v5-bge-base-en-v1.5', 'finaura-v5-bge-large-en-v1.5'].
All share the current rules.py. On sets b/b0 the legacy TF-IDF is refit on the same 80% human split.

## a_synthetic_unseen_merchants (n=3468)

| metric | legacy | v4 | v5 |
|---|---|---|---|
| category_accuracy | 45.0% | 73.1% | 90.3% |
| category_macro_f1 | 48.9% | 72.3% | 89.7% |
| type_accuracy | 62.9% | 77.5% | 91.8% |
